  m_Name: JournalEntry2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalEntry
  entryTitle: Field Notes - The Glow
  diskItemId: data_disk_02
  entryText: 'The plants look like they''re  breathing light. Doc thinks the bioluminescence
    is tied to radiation absorption somehow, like the flora evolved to feed on it.
    If she''s right, that''s huge. It would mean we have a natural way to bring radiation
    levels down across the whole region.



    - K. Reyes, Mission Log 014


    P.S.
    password is radiation'
  unlockOrder: 2
  ambientSound: {fileID: 0}
  isLocked: 1
  password: light
  passwordHint: Check the previous log entry
